/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (Retail businesses such as malls, supermarkets, and retail chains often face difficulties in managing sales, inventory, employees, customers, and payments across multiple branches using traditional POS systems. Most existing POS solutions are either hardware-dependent, costly, lack scalability, or do not support real-time analytics and centralized control.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 47 0 R
/E (Small and medium enterprises also struggle with POS systems that do not provide role-based access, subscription models, or cloud-based multi-tenant architecture. This creates inefficiencies in business operations, inventory mismatches, limited reporting capabilities, and poor customer experience.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
75 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
